      <category>mental-health</category>
      <category>psychology</category>
      <category>philosophy</category>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[
        <h2>Mood Colors Your Reality</h2>
        <p>Your mood is not just a feeling — it is a <em>rendering condition</em>.</p>
        <figure>
          <img src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/1024/1*mood-hero.png" alt="Mood hero image"/>
          <figcaption>The mood as a rendering lens</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <blockquote>Perception is filtered through emotional state.</blockquote>
        <p>Understanding this changes how you interpret experience.</p>
        <img src="https://medium.com/_/stat?event=post.clientViewed&amp;referrerSource=full_rss&amp;postId=f284b362c931" width="1" height="1" alt="">
      ]]></content:encoded>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>Same Input, Different Experience</title>
