      <category>self-awareness</category>
      <category>cognitive-science</category>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[
        <h2>Same Input, Different Experience</h2>
        <p>Two people can read the same sentence and feel entirely different things.</p>
        <img src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/1*same-input.jpg" alt="Same input diagram"/>
        <p>This is the foundation of constructed perception.</p>
        <img src="https://medium.com/_/stat?event=post.clientViewed&amp;referrerSource=full_rss&amp;postId=a1b2c3d4e5f6" width="1" height="1" alt="">
